<description><levelledPara><title>General</title><para>The VH-15 hydraulic power unit supplies hydraulic oil under pressure to one double-acting actuator. It is a self-contained unit: the reservoir, the motor-pump group, the valves, the filtration and the electrical switches are installed on one frame.</para><para>The unit operates with hydraulic oil HLP 46 to DIN 51524-2.</para></levelledPara><levelledPara><title>Main data</title><para><randomList><listItem><para>Motor: 5.5 kW, 4-pole, 400 V, 50 Hz, efficiency class IE3.</para></listItem><listItem><para>Pump: gear pump, displacement 16 cm³ per revolution, flow approximately 22 L/min.</para></listItem><listItem><para>Rated pressure: 140 bar. The pressure relief valve is set to 150 bar.</para></listItem><listItem><para>Reservoir: 60 L. The oil volume at the maximum level is 50 L.</para></listItem><listItem><para>Filtration: 125 micrometers on the suction side, 10 micrometers on the return side.</para></listItem><listItem><para>Control voltage of the directional valve: 24 V DC.</para></listItem></randomList></para></levelledPara><levelledPara><title>Main assemblies</title><para>The unit has these main assemblies:</para><para><randomList><listItem><para>Reservoir: <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="VH15" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="10" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="040" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></para></listItem><listItem><para>Motor-pump group: <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="VH15" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="20" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="040" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></para></listItem><listItem><para>Manifold and valves: <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="VH15" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="30" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="040" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></para></listItem><listItem><para>Return filter: <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="VH15" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="40" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="040" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></para></listItem><listItem><para>Hoses and fittings</para></listItem><listItem><para>Electrical assembly: <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="VH15" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="60" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="040" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></para></listItem></randomList></para><para>For the function of the hydraulic circuit, refer to <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="VH15" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="00" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="042" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef>.</para></levelledPara></description>
